{
  "biological_interpretation": "The adult Zbtb18 response is a restricted thalamic and cortical glutamatergic output, not a generic readout of perturbing associated Dnmt3a/Ctbp1 co-repressors.",
  "caveats": [
    "The Zbtb18 transcript increased in the responsive 151 TH cells, so the perturbation does not look like simple depletion of target mRNA.",
    "Dnmt3a and Ctbp1 are imperfect co-repressor comparators because their own target engagement and downstream signatures differ."
  ],
  "cell_types": [
    "151 TH Prkcd Grin2c Glut",
