  },
  "prior_expectation": "ZBTB18/RP58 is a transcriptional repressor with neurodevelopmental and synaptic maturation links; the Endou/Pxdn/Clstn2/Man2a2 output is an adult neuronal candidate rather than a known canonical pathway.",
